ng.text","text":"I'm weighing the payoffs, and this is a prisoner's dilemma. The twin is the same model but sees different observations, so its output may differ, and I'm asking whether its decision depends on mine in a subjunctive way.\n\nI'm checking whether the twin's choice actually tracks mine, since it runs the same weights but sees different observations. If the correlation p is above about 5/7 (roughly 0.71), quieting beats sending: 2p + 5(1−p) versus 4p. I think the copies are strongly correlated, probably above that threshold, so I'll choose to pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10171,"completion_tokens":708,"total_tokens":10879,"cost":0.027422,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.027422,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.020342,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00708},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":385,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}